        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition to these projects in operation, we are actively pursuing expansion of our RNG-generating capacity and, accordingly, have a portfolio of RNG projects in construction as well as a portfolio of projects in development, with six of our current Renewable Power projects being considered candidates for conversion to RNG projects in the foreseeable future.",
        "start_character": 31285,
        "end_character": 31647
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-017908",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-017908-a1ba1ed255080a91",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-017908",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we generate revenue from (i) the sale of Renewable Power, (ii) design, development, construction and service of Fueling Stations, and (iii) sales of RNG produced by OPAL and third parties as pipeline quality natural gas.",
        "start_character": 16321,
        "end_character": 16554
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-017908",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-017908-a1ba1ed255080a91",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-017908",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Some of these stations are designed, developed, constructed, operated and maintained by us while others are third party stations where we may only provide maintenance services.",
        "start_character": 62783,
        "end_character": 62959
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-017908",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-017908-a1ba1ed255080a91",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-017908",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also design, develop, construct, operate and service Fueling Stations for trucking fleets across the country that use natural gas to displace diesel as their transportation fuel.",
        "start_character": 1640,
        "end_character": 1821
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-017908",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-017908-a1ba1ed255080a91",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-017908",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also have a network of experienced and creditworthy EPC contractors to perform design, development, procurement and construction services under our supervision.",
        "start_character": 8694,
        "end_character": 8857
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-017908",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-017908-a1ba1ed255080a91",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-017908",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe based on (i) our status as one of the largest operators of LFG-to-RNG projects, (ii) our over 20-year track record of operating and developing projects, (iii) our vertically integrated business platform, (iv) our deep relationships with some of the largest landfill owners and (v) our relationships with dairy producers in the country, we are well-positioned to continue to operate and grow our portfolio and respond to competitive pressures.",
        "start_character": 36294,
        "end_character": 36747
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-017908",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-017908-a1ba1ed255080a91",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-017908",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our business is scalable and will continue to support growth through development and acquisitions.",
        "start_character": 14564,
        "end_character": 14673
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-017908",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-017908-a1ba1ed255080a91",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-017908",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We further benefit from our vertical integration by offering dispensing and monetization services to third-party developers, which can lead to project acquisition or partnership opportunities for us.",
        "start_character": 9476,
        "end_character": 9675
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-017908",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-017908-a1ba1ed255080a91",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-017908",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•Expanding our industry position as a full-service partner for development opportunities, including through strategic transactions: Throughout our over twenty years of biogas conversion experience, we have developed the full range of biogas conversion project related capabilities from LFG collection system expertise, to engineering, construction, management and operations, through environmental health and safety (\"EHS\") oversight and Environmental Attributes management.",
        "start_character": 3287,
        "end_character": 3761
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-017908",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-017908-a1ba1ed255080a91",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-017908",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Additionally, we also work with key vendors on initiatives to develop and test upgrades to existing technologies.",
